### GET tutti i candidati
GET http://localhost:8080/api/candidates


### GET candidato per id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/candidates/3


### POST nuovo candidato
POST http://localhost:8080/api/candidates
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Danilo",
  "email": "danilo@email.it",
  "targetRole": "Java Developer"
}


### PUT modifica candidato
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/candidates/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Franco",
  "email": "Danilo.il@lar.it",
  "targetRole": "Full Stack Developer"
}


### DELETE candidato
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/candidates/3